newOrChanged:
src/lib/domain/training/types.ts and schemas.ts (M3, after M4's log-gaps-service, its last earlier editor; one hunk each). WeekTargets gains optional keys, each with schema bounds:
- mainLifts {repsMin, repsMax, topRpe, setsFactor}
- setsPerGroup {min, max, step}: this week's hard-set range per major group, and the planned weekly step
- running {longRunMetres | null, raceSpecific: marathon_pace | threshold | intervals | null, cutback}
- combat {sessions, hardSparring, sparringRounds, conditioningRounds}
- maintenance: a list of streams (strength, hypertrophy, runs, muay_thai, custom)
The keys must be in the schema, because the zod object would otherwise strip them. They live in program_weeks.targets (jsonb), so old weeks read unchanged.

src/lib/domain/programming/evaluate/types.ts (new; types and labels only):
- SYSTEMS (lower, upper, aerobic, combat, cns) with labels, and DayLoad
- Finding {rule, area, severity, days, sessions [{lineage?, title, date}], headline, message, why, resolution? {kind: priority_kept | owner_moved | commitment_fixed | no_room, text}, actionable}
- WeekEvaluation {score, grade: clear | minor | conflicts, findings, days?, fingerprint}
- GoalMode (primary | secondary | maintenance), EffectivePriority and ResolutionHint

src/lib/domain/training/replan.ts (new; zod/mini; imported by path, never from the training index, so zod stays out of client JS).
replanDirectiveSchema, discriminated by kind:
- priorities {cause: reorder | status | event | goal_update | coach}
- block {phase (any planned phase, maintenance included), weeks 3–8, focusGoalRef?}
- taper {goalRef, kind: full | mini}
- deload {week (a Monday), trigger: reactive | owner | coach, reasons: at most 5, each ≤ 160 characters}
replanPayloadSchema: {directive, from (a Monday), baseVersionNumber ≥ 1, fingerprint, shapeDigest}.

src/lib/domain/programming/periodisation/replan.ts (new):
- replanSkeleton(input, {today, from, current: ProgramPlan, directive}) → {mechanism, cutAt, replaces, dates, directives with weekPlan, outline, decisions}, or a refusal with its reason
- generateReplan(input, skeleton, previous) → {blocks, outline, weeks (for a splice or in place), decisions (replanned first), fingerprint, shapeDigest}
